/**
 * Chemotherapy, pathological complete response and residual cancer burden, platinum, post-neoadjuvant capecitabine,
 * PARP inhibition updates, PD-L1 assay concordance, tumour-infiltrating lymphocytes, first-line antibody-drug
 * conjugates, the AKT failure, HER2-low and ctDNA papers for the triple-negative breast cancer deep dive. Metadata
 * verbatim from Europe PMC, read 2026-09-24; figures only from the indexed abstracts.
 *
 * The primary papers of KEYNOTE-522 (2020, 2022, 2024), KEYNOTE-355 (2020, 2022), IMpassion130 (2018, 2020) and 131,
 * ASCENT (2021), ASCENT-03 and -04, DESTINY-Breast04 (2022, 2025), OlympiA (2021), OlympiAD, EMBRACA, BrighTNess
 * (2018), GeparSixto (2014), TNT and the 2007 residual cancer burden paper already exist in the corpus and are linked
 * by id from the roadmap, not repeated here.
 */
