    authors: "Garber JE, Cameron D, Campbell C, et al.", paperType: "rct", participants: 1836, changedPractice: true,
    findings: ["At 6.1 years: invasive disease-free survival hazard ratio 0.65 (95 percent CI 0.53 to 0.78); distant disease-free survival 0.65; overall survival 0.72 (0.56 to 0.93).", "Six-year overall survival 87.5 vs 83.2 percent (difference 4.4 points, 95 percent CI 0.9 to 6.7).", "Myelodysplastic syndrome or acute myeloid leukaemia 0.4 vs 0.7 percent; fewer new BRCA-associated breast and ovarian cancers."],
