    whatItMeans: "The evidence behind the stage I de-escalation statement on the triple-negative page: an ordinary haematoxylin and eosin slide identifies a fifth of patients whose outcome without chemotherapy matches treated cohorts. A prospective trial of chemotherapy omission is the missing step.",
