    caveats: ["Open-label design; progression-free survival was centrally reviewed to compensate.", "Excluded patients eligible for immunotherapy, so it does not compare with pembrolizumab-based first-line treatment; TROPION-Breast05 does.", "Interstitial lung disease is a class risk and its rate is read from the full paper, not the abstract."],
